  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards malaria elimination in Haiti - Haiti (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haiti, Malaria, United Nations Development Programme (UNDP Haiti)This program has the following goals: contribuer a&#x300; l&#x2019;ame&#x301;lioration de la sante&#x301; des populations d&#x2019;Hai&#x308;ti par l&#x2019;interruption de la transmission autochtone de la malaria. / To contribute to the improvement of the health of Haiti&apos;s populations by interrupting the indigenous transmission of malaria.. The objectives of this program are: 100% des cas suspects dans la population ont acce&#x300;s a&#x300; un diagnostic pre&#x301;coce soutenu par un programme d&#x2019;assurance qualite&#x301; et ont acce&#x300;s a&#x300; un traitement efficace sans de&#x301;lai. / 100% of suspected cases in the population have access to early diagnosis supported by a quality assurance program and have immediate access to effective treatment..  La gestion de la chaine d&#x2019;approvisionnement assurera la disponibilite&#x301; d&#x2019;intrants, de me&#x301;dicaments et autres consommables me&#x301;dicaux a&#x300; tout moment au niveau institutionnel et communautaire / Supply chain management will ensure the availability of devices, medicines, and other medical consumables at all times at the institutional and community levels..  Renforcer la surveillance de la malaria, le suivi et l&#x2019;e&#x301;valuation du programme a&#x300; tous les niveaux, y compris au niveau institutionnel et au niveau communautaire / Enhance malaria surveillance, program monitoring, and evaluation at all levels, including at the institutional and community levels..  Renforcer la surveillance entomologique de la malaria a&#x300; tous les niveaux et s&#x2019;assurer que 100% des foyers ont acce&#x300;s aux mesures efficaces de protection contre la malaria /Enhance entomological surveillance of malaria at all levels and ensure that 100% of households have access to effective malaria protection measures..  La Gestion du programme est renforce&#x301;e au niveau national, dans les 10 de&#x301;partements et dans les 146 communes / Program management is strengthened at the national level, in all 10 departments, and in the 146 municipalities..  Contribuer par des interventions de communication efficaces a&#x300; l&#x2019;e&#x301;limination de la transmission locale de la malaria en Hai&#x308;ti d&#x2019;ici de&#x301;cembre 2025 / Contribute through effective communication interventions to the elimination of local malaria transmission in Haiti by December 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
